<title>UK: Dresdner sets warrants on Valora AG.</title>
<headline>Dresdner sets warrants on Valora AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Valora AG, lead manager Banque International de Placement said.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    340.00 CHF		PREMIUM	16.46 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.93 CHF		  GEARING	8.40 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.APR.97-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	02.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  325.00 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
